      "content": "Based on the transcript, I'll help you extract high-level, actionable items. Here's a suggested task list:\n\n1. Investigation and fix of authentication service 500 errors before the release on Friday.\n2. Review and optimization of database migration script for the user profiles.\n3. Improvement of dashboard UI to reduce heavy API call load.\n4. Update of documentation for the new API endpoints to support frontend team.\n\nThese tasks accurately capture the main issues and concerns raised during the discussion, from technical problems to user experience and documentation requirements, without focusing on trivial or unnecessary details.",
